# Nightly restart of wikimon v2. Defense-in-depth against EventStreams
# poison-pill wedges; the 2026-09-11 oversized-event outage ran 71h because
# the process was 124 days old and replayed a bad resume offset forever.
# See https://goodturn.ai/p/gtp_01m2h0yfsfe5sv50y2h6vkb3zf
# Install: sudo install -m 644 -o root -g root conf/wikimon.cron /etc/cron.d/wikimon
0 9 * * * root /usr/bin/supervisorctl restart wikimon >/dev/null 2>&1
